--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3f594cbd84ec1cf428b3ec106fd3532b, type: 3}
  m_Name: DialogueConfig
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueConfig
  allDialogues:
  - key: 0
    entries:
    - charLeft: {fileID: 0}
      charRight: {fileID: 0}
      messages:
      - isLeft: 0
        title: ???
        messages:
        - Help me...!
    - charLeft: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e39b47009a773384db244d6222608cae, type: 3}
      charRight: {fileID: 0}
      messages:
      - isLeft: 1
        title: Rocky
        messages:
        - I hear a voice somewhere.
        - Maybe someone needs help. Let's seek them out.
  - key: 1
    entries:
    - charLeft: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e39b47009a773384db244d6222608cae, type: 3}
      charRight: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5dd4ead9871b9bc41be0f2a49c678292, type: 3}
      messages:
      - isLeft: 0
        title: Profs
        messages:
        - Hey, thank you! This area is so dangerous.
      - isLeft: 1
        title: Rocky
        messages:
        - What are you doing here? I thought everyone evacuated.
      - isLeft: 0
        title: Profs
        messages:
        - My base is near here. But let's get out of here first.
      - isLeft: 1
        title: Rocky
        messages:
        - We should find the exit.
  - key: 2
    entries:
    - charLeft: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5dd4ead9871b9bc41be0f2a49c678292, type: 3}
      charRight: {fileID: 0}
      messages:
      - isLeft: 1
        title: Profs
        messages:
        - We're getting close to my shelter.
  - key: 3
    entries:
    - charLeft: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5dd4ead9871b9bc41be0f2a49c678292, type: 3}
      charRight: {fileID: 0}
      messages:
      - isLeft: 1
        title: Profs
        messages:
        - Finally, we reach to the Shelter.
  - key: 4
    entries:
    - charLeft: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e39b47009a773384db244d6222608cae, type: 3}
      charRight: {fileID: 0}
      messages:
      - isLeft: 1
        title: Rocky
        messages:
        - I need to find where the sound comes from first.
  - key: 5
    entries:
    - charLeft: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d9fed97f5551de44e85ab70e1bc28e69, type: 3}
      charRight: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5dd4ead9871b9bc41be0f2a49c678292, type: 3}
      messages:
      - isLeft: 0
        title: Profs
        messages:
        - Relax! You can breath normally here.
      - isLeft: 1
        title: Rocky
        messages:
        - Oh. The air here is so clean.
  - key: 6
    entries:
    - charLeft: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d9fed97f5551de44e85ab70e1bc28e69, type: 3}
      charRight: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5dd4ead9871b9bc41be0f2a49c678292, type: 3}
      messages:
      - isLeft: 0
        title: Profs
        messages:
        - Take your time. You've earned a rest.
      - isLeft: 1
        title: Rocky
        messages:
        - What is this place?
      - isLeft: 0
        title: Profs
        messages:
        - A Safe Zone.
        - One of the few places where people can still live without a gas mask.
      - isLeft: 1
        title: Rocky
        messages:
        - "So we\u2019re staying here? "
      - isLeft: 0
        title: Profs
        messages:
        - For now.
        - Look around. Get familiar with the place.
        - Come talk to me when you're ready.
  - key: 7
    entries:
    - charLeft: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5dd4ead9871b9bc41be0f2a49c678292, type: 3}
      charRight: {fileID: 0}
      messages:
      - isLeft: 1
        title: Rocky
        messages:
        - " I need to talk with Prof first. There\u2019s still something I need to
          finish here."
  - key: 8
    entries:
    - charLeft: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d9fed97f5551de44e85ab70e1bc28e69, type: 3}
      charRight: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5dd4ead9871b9bc41be0f2a49c678292, type: 3}
      messages:
      - isLeft: 0
        title: Profs
        messages:
        - Have you looked around the Safe Zone yet?
      - isLeft: 1
        title: Rocky
        messages:
        - Yeah. It's a bit damp, but much better than outside.
      - isLeft: 0
        title: Profs
        messages:
        - I'm glad you like it.
        - But there's still a lot of work to do.
      - isLeft: 1
        title: Rocky
        messages:
        - How can I help?
      - isLeft: 0
        title: Profs
        messages:
        - We need Scrap Metal to repair things.
        - Could you head to the Surface Zone and collect some for me?
      - isLeft: 1
        title: Rocky
        messages:
        - ' Sure! Leave it to me.'
  - key: 9
    entries:
    - charLeft: {fileID: 0}
      charRight: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5dd4ead9871b9bc41be0f2a49c678292, type: 3}
      messages:
      - isLeft: 0
        title: Profs
        messages:
        - Get 10 Scrap Metalsq and give back to me. Thanks!
